    {
      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "P1 durability fix (2026-09-23, Approach A approved): after the File.Move in AtomicWrite, fsync the destination\u0027s directory. Windows: CreateFile(dir, FILE_FLAG_BACKUP_SEMANTICS|GENERIC_READ) \u002B FlushFileBuffers \u002B CloseHandle (kernel32 convention). Linux/macOS: open(dir, O_RDONLY|O_DIRECTORY) \u002B fsync(fd) \u002B close (libc convention). Wrap in FileRetry.Run. Tolerate directory-vanished race (CreateFile/open not-found: swallow \u2014 the move already succeeded); all other failures surface as IOException \u2192 wra",
