      "contentPreview": "P1 tests: (1) positive \u2014 install DurableFile.FailureInjector as recorder (returns null), do an atomic write, assert BeforeDirSync invoked (proves dir fsynced on every durable write); (2) fault/rollback \u2014 FailPersistentlyAt(BeforeDirSync) \u2192 assert DurableWriteException surfaces and append rolls back cleanly (no leftover temp, consistent journal state); (3) not-found tolerance \u2014 vanished directory does not fail an otherwise-successful write.",
